    "name": "Classic Pork Broth",
    "description": "This thick, concentrated broth is gelatinous and full of flavor — simply dilute with water to your desired consistency. Lightly salted to enhance its naturally rich, umami profile, it's made with roasted bones, fresh vegetables, and aromatic herbs for a deep, satisfying taste.\n\nPerfect as a base for ramen, soups, stews, risotto, or just sip on its own.\n\nIngredients: Pork Bones, Water, Onion, Carrot, Celery, Garlic, Salt, Thyme, Apple Cider Vinegar, Black Peppercorns, Bay Leaf",
